  {
   "heading": "Questions? We can read your mind",
   "items": [
    {
     "q": "What are the jobs after BBA?",
     "a": [
      "BBA graduates from ATLAS ISME pursue roles such as Marketing Executive/Manager, Financial Analyst, Business Analyst, Product Manager, Data Analyst, Business Development Manager, Credit Analyst, Management Trainee, Portfolio Manager and Investment Banker, across corporates, start-ups and their own ventures."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "What is BBA salary?",
     "a": [
      "The website does not specify exact salary figures. However, with 700+ students placed at companies and 2,400+ on-campus interviews conducted, ATLAS ISME graduates are consistently hired by top Indian and global firms, with compensation varying by role, specialisation and company."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Which BBA has the highest salary?",
     "a": [
      "Specialisations in Finance, Business Analytics and AI & Emerging Technologies typically attract the highest starting packages, as these roles are in high demand and command strong compensation across industries."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Can I become CEO after BBA?",
     "a": [
      "A BBA is a strong starting point for an entrepreneurial or leadership career. ATLAS ISME actively supports students in launching their own ventures and many alumni have gone on to become founders and business leaders. Combined with an MBA or relevant work experience, the pathway to a CEO role is very much achievable."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Is BBA enough to get a job?",
     "a": [
      "Yes. ATLAS ISME's Career Services team offers end-to-end support ensuring students are industry-ready. With 500+ recruiters on campus and partnerships with 700+ companies, a BBA from ATLAS ISME is well-suited to landing a strong first job."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Which BBA job has the highest salary?",
     "a": [
      "Roles in Investment Banking, Data & Business Analytics, Product Management and Performance Marketing typically command the highest starting salaries among BBA graduates. These are also the roles that ATLAS ISME's specialised BBA programs are specifically designed to prepare students for."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "What is the average package for BBA graduates during campus placements in India?",
     "a": [
      "The page does not publish specific average salary figures. For the most accurate and up-to-date placement data, it is recommended to reach out directly to the ATLAS ISME Career Services team or visit the Placements section of the website."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Which companies typically hire from business school campus placement drives?",
     "a": [
      "ATLAS ISME has 500+ recruiters on campus. Companies that hire include Deloitte, KPMG, Goldman Sachs, HDFC, Colgate, NSE, Motilal Oswal, Edelweiss, Zomato, IBM, Dr. Reddy's Laboratories, Marico, Jio, L&T, Marsh McLennan, Urban Company, Aditya Birla Group and many more across sectors."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "How should I prepare for campus placements during my BBA?",
     "a": [
      "ATLAS ISME's Career Support Framework covers everything students need: aspiration mapping, resume building, portfolio development, one-on-one career counselling, mock interviews, AI-powered interview prep, placement orientation, personal grooming, industry engagement and weekly career services lectures. The goal is to ensure every student is placement-ready well before interviews begin."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "What industries do BBA graduates typically get placed in?",
     "a": [
      "ATLAS ISME graduates are placed across a wide range of industries including banking and financial services, consulting, marketing and advertising, FMCG, technology, fintech, media, retail, insurance and entrepreneurship, reflecting the breadth of the BBA specialisations offered and the diversity of the recruiter network."
     ]
    }
   ],
   "kind": "faq"
  }
 ]
